<?xml version="1.0"?>
<package>
	<metadata>
		<id>Rappen.XrmToolBox.Shuffle.Builder</id>
		<version>1.0.0</version>
		<title>Shuffle Builder for XrmToolBox</title>
		<authors>Jonas Rapp, Imran Akram</authors>
		<owners>rappen, imranakram</owners>
		<projectUrl>https://jonasr.app/shuffle/</projectUrl>
		<iconUrl>https://jonasr.app/wp-content/uploads/Shuffle-2B.png</iconUrl>
		<requireLicenseAcceptance>false</requireLicenseAcceptance>
		<description>
			The Shuffle Builder helps you to create schema definition files.

			Installing this tool, will also include the other tools for the Shuffle:
			Shuffle Runner and Shuffle Deployer.

			Read more: https://jonasr.app/shuffle
		</description>
		<summary>Build schema files for the Shuffle. Empower yourself to achieve more.</summary>
		<releaseNotes>
Changes since 1.2023.5:

- New Batch size field on the Import node (default 1, no batching; max 1000).
- New Defer state and owner checkbox on the Import node, with a tooltip explaining when it helps.
- New Bypass sync logic, Bypass async logic and Bypass flows checkboxes on the ShuffleDefinition node.
- Definitions follow the updated schema: BatchSize and DeferStateAndOwner on Import; BypassSyncLogic, BypassAsyncLogic and BypassFlows on ShuffleDefinition.
- .NET Framework 4.8; ILMerge removed; DotNetZip replaced with System.IO.Compression.

The import engine changes are listed in the Shuffle Runner release notes.
Full details: https://github.com/rappen/Xrm.Shuffle#whats-new-since-120235
		</releaseNotes>
		<copyright>Copyright 2023-2026 Jonas Rapp, Imran Akram</copyright>
		<tags>XrmToolBox Shuffle</tags>
		<dependencies>
			<dependency id="XrmToolBox" version="1.2025.10.74" />
		</dependencies>
	</metadata>
	<files>
		<file src="bin\Release\Rappen.XTB.Shuffle.dll" target="lib\net48\Plugins" />
	</files>
</package>